                <pb facs="0317" n="307" sameAs="frus:frus1937v05/pg307"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">824.6363 ST 2/198: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Caldwell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-11-27T17:00:00-04:00">November 27, 1937—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received November 27—3:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>68. Captain Calvo, Chief Counsel of Standard Oil Company, deported to the
                    Argentine Republic today. Metzger requests that New York be notified.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caldwell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
